          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "My tracking status hasn't updated in a few days. Should I be concerned?",
            "answer": "<p>There is usually no need to worry. International shipments can experience temporary tracking pauses while moving through sorting hubs, customs checkpoints, or regional delivery networks. If your tracking status remains unchanged for more than five business days, contact our support team so we can investigate it with the carrier.</p>"
          }
