            "question": "What inspires the NEERA living movement?",
            "answer": "<p>NEERA was founded with a deep respect for personal wellness, mindful living, and ancestral wisdom. Our venture is fueled by a commitment to bringing the time-tested, holistic benefits of the Ayurvedic lifestyle into modern homes. Every piece is designed to support everyday well-being while honoring and preserving the heritage of traditional handcrafted artistry.</p>"
